cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below, and cite the FANet paper it builds on."
title: SpectraFAN
abstract: "Frequency-domain attention for crystallographic image segmentation. A two-phase research project on top of FANet: (1) make the Frequency Attention Module materially faster at inference and in training with no accuracy loss, via a real-input FFT, kernel fusion and CUDA-graph capture, and a real-valued DCT-domain variant; (2) inject crystallographic frequency priors derived from lattice symmetry to improve data efficiency and sim-to-real transfer."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Iyer
    given-names: Karthik
repository-code: "https://github.com/karthikiyerrrr/SpectraFAN"
license: MIT
version: 0.0.1
keywords:
  - frequency-domain attention
  - image segmentation
  - electron microscopy
  - crystallography
  - FANet
